	(text "Surge \nStopper"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.35 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "151f16ab-ff8c-439a-834c-837b4e9f5121")
	)
	(text "D9 (1N4148W): This diode provides a bypass path to the capacitor. \nIn a fast transient, it helps the LTC4364 hold the gate low and \nprevents the MOSFET from \"self-enhancing\" (turning back on accidentally) \ndue to rapid voltage changes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.442 206.502 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2346b5a7-1ab3-4f8d-9fcf-3ee61e24c33f")
	)
	(text "FB_Vclamp = 1.25V x (205k + 4.02k) / 4.02k = 64.99V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.292 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "236beeea-a0d5-4a4d-bf54-4e0ba56a54ce")
	)
	(text "For 24V or higher supplies, connect\na 15V Zener between DGATE and SOURCE.\nDatasheet, page 8"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 32.512 112.522 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "29fb655c-0d84-4c4f-87a4-930193bbcfd0")
	)
	(text "tCOOL = 63 × CTMR × 1.2 V / 2 µA\ntCOOL = 63 × 0.1 µF × 1.2 / 2 µA\ntCOOL ≈ 3.8 seconds\n\nFault duration depends on fault type and VCC-OUT.\nVerify CTMR against the pass-MOSFET SOA before release."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 331.47 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "39fe5d39-3969-4049-9b2d-7c8df48ee4d6")
	)
	(text "LTC4364 Threshold Calculations (Vref = 1.25V):\n\n1. UV Threshold (Low Voltage Cutoff):\nV_UV = 1.25 * ((R14 + R15 + R16) / (R15 + R16))\n\n2. OV Threshold (High Voltage Clamp/Cutoff):\nV_OV = 1.25 * ((R14 + R15 + R16) / R16)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 249.174 168.402 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "69e45834-bc20-4abd-b012-6f32cce6ba6d")
	)
	(text "LTC4364 uses the FB pin to clamp the output voltage at 1.25V at the pin"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.098 57.404 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6d78308e-8f18-4952-9fe3-32be0fd73d3b")
	)
	(text "R12 (100Ohms recommended): The compensation capacitor (C15) is necessary \nfor loop stability, but it can slow down how fast the HGATE pin can pull \nlow during a fault. R12 decouples the capacitor during fast turn-off events."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7329c707-5680-4478-8c97-f2eaa37c7900")
	)
	(text "Surge / ideal-diode controller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 234.95 78.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "87290178-71b2-5e51-a3da-1544eb61a521")
	)
	(text "Current sense resistor\n1%, 2512 package, 0.5 W or 1 W\nRoute SENSE/OUT as Kelvin traces to the resistor pads\n10 mOhms = 5A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.242 69.088 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9201e893-0240-4582-b0d2-9f2b8769e787")
	)
	(text "UV: 1.25V × 560.4k / (27.4k + 10k) = 18.7V\nOV: 1.25V × 560.4k / 10k = 70V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 249.174 147.066 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "96bfb9b4-908e-41fb-b7e4-2eccd2f37243")
	)
	(text "Reverse polarity:\nFigure 15 ground-lift network targets transients to -70 V.\nD12 must be a 68 V Zener VCC clamp (CMZ5945B class);\nSMCJ70A is not an equivalent substitute."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a2cbb18b-e2e9-4daa-855f-882f7a83f763")
	)
	(text "LTC4364 uses pin TMR to \"throttle\" \nhow long the MOSFET is allowed to \nstay in a stressful state (clamping \n70V while the input might be 80V+)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 29.21 131.318 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d14d807b-06d7-4f45-8377-f44da544e008")
	)
	(text "ideal diode \nMOSFET"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d2886b00-126e-49b7-bd42-4056969071a5")
	)
